<title>USA: Accuhealth Inc acquires ProHealthCare.</title>
<headline>Accuhealth Inc acquires ProHealthCare.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Accuhealth Inc said Monday it acquired ProHealthCare Infusion Services Inc in a tax-free exchange of stock for about $1.2 million.</p>
<p>The company said the acquisition of the Springfield, New Jersey-based company will strenghten its position as a major provider of care for HIV/AIDS patients in the tri-state area.</p>
